Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:20:11 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] S5: session-scoped budgets and cleanup at session end

LimitEnforcer.forget_scope(), a once-per-connection exit_stack hook in
ToolManager.call_tool that drops a session's budgets when its connection
closes, and MCPServer.forget_session_limits() for manual cleanup.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
